      <h2 class='c-post-card__title'>
        <a href='/posts/opinion-fuzzing-a-proposal-for-reducing-exploring-variance-in-llm-judgments-via-sampling/' class='c-post-card__title-link'>
          Opinion Fuzzing: A Proposal for Reducing &amp; Exploring Variance in LLM Judgments Via Sampling
        </a>
      </h2>

      <p class='c-post-card__excerpt'>Summary
LLM outputs vary substantially across models, prompts, and simulated perspectives. I propose &quot;opinion fuzzing&quot; for systematically sampling across these dimensions to quantify and understand this variance. The concept is simple, but making it practically usable will require thoughtful tooling. In this piece I discuss what opinion fuzzing</p>
